# Keel — workspace ignores

# --- third-party clones, excluded by decision 2026-11-13 ---
# research/ holds third-party clones this workspace used as reference:
#   research/codex  — pristine OpenAI Codex CLI (Apache-2.0)
#   research/rea    — github.com/morluto/rea (reverse-engineering tool)
#   research/spl    — github.com/asgeirtj/system_prompts_leaks (leaked prompts)
# Upstream content, not this project's work; spl must not be redistributed.
# Re-clone any of them on demand instead of vendoring them into this repo.
research/

# --- scratch probe repo (own git dir, no remote; leave on disk) ---
.probe/

# --- generated stress-test artifacts (paths too long for Windows) ---
.verify-skills/blackbox/

# --- secrets: never commit tokens or local env ---
**/.env.local
**/.env*.local
**/.env

